<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the Spanish first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Valladolid 3 (Alen Peternac 10th minute, Victor Fernandez 16th,</p>
<p>Jose Quevedo, 80th) Compostela 1 (Cristopher Ohen 68th).</p>
<p>Halftime 2-0. Attendance 18,000</p>
<p>Extremadura 2 (Igor Gluscevic 11th, 71st) Zaragoza 1 (Gustavo</p>
<p>Lopez 91st). 1-0. 10,000</p>
<p>Athletic Bilbao 2 (Joseba Etxeberra 17th, Julen Guerrero 51st)</p>
<p>Tenerife 0. 1-0. 41,000</p>
<p>Real Madrid 6 (Predrag Mijatovic 31st, 89th, Davor Suker 43rd,</p>
<p>pen.68th and 90th, Hakan Mild own goal 64th) Real Sociedad 1</p>
<p>(Darko Kovacevic 11th). 2-1. 73,000</p>
<p>Deportivo 2 (Rivaldo 48th, Mikael Madar 66th) Espanyol 0. 0-0.</p>
<p>23,000</p>
<p>Hercules 1 (Dubravko Pavlicic 65th) Oviedo 1 (Oli Alvarez 44th). 0-1. 14,000.</p>
